.TH std::philox_engine::min 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::philox_engine::min \- std::philox_engine::min

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr result_type min();  (since C++26)

Returns the minimum value potentially generated by the random-number engine.

.SH Return value

0u

.SH Complexity

Constant.

.SH See also

max      gets the largest possible value in the output range
